{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOW LONG CAN YOU SURVIVE THE STOLEN REALM?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stolen Realm Survivors is an online co-op survivors-like auto-shooter set in the world of Stolen Realm. Battle relentless hordes, collect powerful artifacts, modify unique skills, and unleash devastating combos as the chaos escalates. Play solo or with friends and push your build as far as it can go before the onslaught overwhelms you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228580/extras/f5644a36e00c8b668b7087b18f1d1807.poster.avif?t=1771682623\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228580/extras/f5644a36e00c8b668b7087b18f1d1807.webm?t=1771682623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228580/extras/f5644a36e00c8b668b7087b18f1d1807.mp4?t=1771682623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REVERSE BULLET HELL, PURE BUILD CRAFTING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character attacks automatically; survival is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge through swarming enemies, position carefully, and make smart upgrade choices as the screen fills with chaos. Combine skills, artifacts, and passives to create wildly different builds each run, from precise spellcasters to screen-clearing powerhouses. Every choice matters. Every run is different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228580/extras/a1a852a7a170a021e21d17c8259bbc47.poster.avif?t=1771682623\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228580/extras/a1a852a7a170a021e21d17c8259bbc47.webm?t=1771682623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228580/extras/a1a852a7a170a021e21d17c8259bbc47.mp4?t=1771682623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GROW STRONGER WITH EVERY RUN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies, complete quests, and take on dangerous events to earn powerful rewards. Level up, collect loot, and modify diverse skills to shape your playstyle on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push deeper into the Realm to face tougher enemies, deadlier encounters, and greater rewards. The longer you survive, the more absurdly powerful your build can become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228580/extras/99b97a99f3ce0a399a96137c566814ca.poster.avif?t=1771682623\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228580/extras/99b97a99f3ce0a399a96137c566814ca.webm?t=1771682623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228580/extras/99b97a99f3ce0a399a96137c566814ca.mp4?t=1771682623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ONLINE CO-OP SURVIVAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive alone or team up with friends in online co-op. Coordinate movement, builds, and upgrades to withstand overwhelming odds as a team. Whether you\u2019re playing carefully or embracing total chaos, survival is always better with allies at your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228580/extras/46e5ab390921685f8838bb40d5c00ee0.poster.avif?t=1771682623\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228580/extras/46e5ab390921685f8838bb40d5c00ee0.webm?t=1771682623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228580/extras/46e5ab390921685f8838bb40d5c00ee0.mp4?t=1771682623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE STOLEN REALM, REIMAGINED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Stolen Realm from a top-down perspective built for nonstop survivors-like action as you escape the ominous halls of Castle Gloom. Experience the Realm in a fast, chaotic, and replayable new way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Realm is relentless. How long will you last?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228580/extras/75776ab05a2c4722771a0151e7afdb8f.poster.avif?t=1771682623\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228580/extras/75776ab05a2c4722771a0151e7afdb8f.webm?t=1771682623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228580/extras/75776ab05a2c4722771a0151e7afdb8f.mp4?t=1771682623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMMUNITY WISDOM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI only planned to play one run. I haven\u2019t seen sunlight since.\u201d - Probably Someone</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3228580?t=1771682623","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3228580?t=1771682623","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228580/28bc1854b5f52f9b8cd6ccd4e27d8d1bcb83b7